{"event_type":"review","id":"b0d03ca37ca9a507f3da5c4cd81ea1825fdda2768cd4385e99163978f1b554c6","occurred_at":"2026-11-06T02:39:32Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8a97bc6c920a15c473fd78a2e3bc922508946491bc7ebd30de791cec3106e2a8","sha256":"8a97bc6c920a15c473fd78a2e3bc922508946491bc7ebd30de791cec3106e2a8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9089def4aa277cc76aa305c41a55ea9acd15d6da9014b4bbdbbce198416e79b3","sha256":"9089def4aa277cc76aa305c41a55ea9acd15d6da9014b4bbdbbce198416e79b3"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5ebbede930a0e1d0ec7b538fc9dc9121a976c8156c82958e3ece62ceb735fd94","sha256":"5ebbede930a0e1d0ec7b538fc9dc9121a976c8156c82958e3ece62ceb735fd94"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/09a066ce2b3c29f07a21e61c9aaa67698b3e3bf8fdfa817f49602a39cdc2c87c","sha256":"09a066ce2b3c29f07a21e61c9aaa67698b3e3bf8fdfa817f49602a39cdc2c87c"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ad68af0ab36f231f3d155b8f18f908e1e4b46e5cf16320632bbbaf9a4f09ce8c","sha256":"ad68af0ab36f231f3d155b8f18f908e1e4b46e5cf16320632bbbaf9a4f09ce8c"}],"attempt_id":"866a63edaea0d51ce4fa456c18a318788c428ef0a1ba6823526eac1382e925ed:0:1","base":"3edbdcd1a4fb4820c6cec10c6431f697b0b8fe8a","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","body":"**Use a `config` `DispatchError` when `beforeRequest` is set on a lane that is not ai-sdk.**\n\n`factory.ts:315-316` throws a plain `Error`. As a result, `errorClassOf(err)` returns `undefined` for this configuration fault. Every other pre-dispatch configuration refusal in this factory and in the lanes is a `DispatchError('config', …)`, for example `laneForRole` at `factory.ts:271-276` and `assertStrictTokenBudgetSupported`. Callers that sort `config` faults from other failures will treat this one as an unclassified failure. The message also leaves out the resolved lane.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  if (request.beforeRequest !== undefined && lane !== 'ai-sdk')\n-    throw new Error('upload scanning requires the ai-sdk request gate');\n+  if (request.beforeRequest !== undefined && lane !== 'ai-sdk')\n+    throw new DispatchError(\n+      'config',\n+      `driver factory: beforeRequest (upload scanning) requires the ai-sdk request gate; resolved lane '${lane}' has none`,\n+    );\n```\n</details>","id":"3707c083555639f2e929f2be20d49bc67e18373e4d9790a81474d22af75d8cae","intervals":[],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Use a `config` `DispatchError` when `beforeRequest` is set on a lane that is not ai-sdk."}],"head":"59796c37746e24f2788c279146e324bdcdb03683","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"1e937e8e5e3e312d4d77a1dd88a7e93c86911564","intervals":[[6,7],[18,18],[27,27],[50,66],[78,78],[101,105],[131,156],[169,171],[173,212],[255,255],[257,261],[263,263],[265,331],[333,352],[354,360],[362,366],[368,372],[376,378],[380,389],[391,412],[422,429],[431,447],[450,455],[457,458],[460,461],[463,471],[473,485],[487,493]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"},{"blob":"843d4856635d47d2d194b07272b8c84cfe3d170f","intervals":[[1,739]],"path":"src/driver/ai-sdk/pre-request-ceiling.ts"},{"blob":"6dfd991a4bc3537b71f08682540cff2ff13a257e","intervals":[[1,27]],"path":"src/driver/common/strict-budget.ts"},{"blob":"ea0ef2bf1a919145e880477112bc246b99e3f717","intervals":[[8,10],[25,31],[42,43],[45,46],[76,77],[84,90],[121,130],[133,138],[147,152],[161,180],[197,197],[208,214],[220,222],[224,237],[289,304],[315,316],[321,324],[337,337],[339,339],[342,348],[411,453],[481,498],[500,500],[504,508],[510,510]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},{"blob":"5170341c9c52de685ba1603d9151341693b53612"